name: Codebase Audit
description: Full codebase audit for missing docs, dead code, and hardcoded values
---
Audit the codebase and provide a prioritized checklist of issues:

1. Functions or classes missing docstrings
2. Dead or unreachable code
3. Hardcoded values that should be environment variables or config
4. Inconsistent naming conventions (snake_case vs camelCase mixing, etc.)
5. Files that have grown too large and should be split
6. Circular imports or poor module organization
7. If .gitmodules exists — any tight coupling to git submodule internals

Output format:
- Group issues by file
- Number each issue
- Mark severity: 🔴 High / 🟡 Medium / 🟢 Low
- Do not fix anything yet — audit only

I will address items one at a time after reviewing this list.
